{"title": "Ethereal", "pageid": 10689, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Ethereal", "categories": ["Passive features", "Pages using deprecated parameters"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Generic_Ethereal.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b0/Generic_Ethereal.webp/300px-Generic_Ethereal.webp, /w/images/b/b0/Generic_Ethereal.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b0/Generic_Ethereal.webp/300px-Generic_Ethereal.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b0/Generic_Ethereal.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Ethereal</b> is a passive feature that marks this entity as a ghost.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Affected entity is incorporeal and can't be <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shove\" title=\"Shove\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6b/Shove_Icon.webp/25px-Shove_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6b/Shove_Icon.webp/38px-Shove_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6b/Shove_Icon.webp/50px-Shove_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Shoved\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6b/Shove_Icon.webp/25px-Shove_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6b/Shove_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Shove\" title=\"Shove\">Shoved</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Throw\" title=\"Throw\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp/25px-Throw_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp/38px-Throw_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp/50px-Throw_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Thrown\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp/25px-Throw_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Throw\" title=\"Throw\">Thrown</a>, or used as an <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Improvised_Melee_Weapon\" title=\"Improvised Melee Weapon\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/52/Improvised_Melee_Weapon_Icon.webp/25px-Improvised_Melee_Weapon_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/52/Improvised_Melee_Weapon_Icon.webp/38px-Improvised_Melee_Weapon_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/52/Improvised_Melee_Weapon_Icon.webp/50px-Improvised_Melee_Weapon_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Improvised Melee Weapon\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/52/Improvised_Melee_Weapon_Icon.webp/25px-Improvised_Melee_Weapon_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/52/Improvised_Melee_Weapon_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Improvised_Melee_Weapon\" title=\"Improvised Melee Weapon\">Improvised Melee Weapon</a> \n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Details\"> Details </span></h3>\n<dl class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dd><details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">Ethereal</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Ethereal\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Ethereal\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></dd>\n</dl>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Air_Elemental\" title=\"Air Elemental\">Air Elemental</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Air_Myrmidon\" title=\"Air Myrmidon\">Air Myrmidon</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Daddy\" title=\"Daddy\">Daddy</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Echo_of_a_Lost_Love\" title=\"Echo of a Lost Love\">Echo of a Lost Love</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Echo_of_Abazigal\" title=\"Echo of Abazigal\">Echo of Abazigal</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Echo_of_Amelyssan\" title=\"Echo of Amelyssan\">Echo of Amelyssan</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Echo_of_Illasera\" title=\"Echo of Illasera\">Echo of Illasera</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Echo_of_Sendai\" title=\"Echo of Sendai\">Echo of Sendai</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Feeble_Spectre\" title=\"Feeble Spectre\">Feeble Spectre</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Fire_Elemental\" title=\"Fire Elemental\">Fire Elemental</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Fire_Myrmidon\" title=\"Fire Myrmidon\">Fire Myrmidon</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Gaseous_Form_(creature)\" title=\"Gaseous Form (creature)\">Gaseous Form (creature)</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Ghislev\" title=\"Ghislev\">Ghislev</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Gordis\" title=\"Gordis\">Gordis</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Manifestation_of_Tyranny\" title=\"Manifestation of Tyranny\">Manifestation of Tyranny</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Mind-Claw_of_Tu%27narath\" title=\"Mind-Claw of Tu'narath\">Mind-Claw of Tu'narath</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Mummy_(wraith)\" title=\"Mummy (wraith)\">Mummy (wraith)</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Mundane_Spectre\" title=\"Mundane Spectre\">Mundane Spectre</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Phantasm\" title=\"Phantasm\">Phantasm</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Pol\" title=\"Pol\">Pol</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Poltergeist\" title=\"Poltergeist\">Poltergeist</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Primordial_Spectre\" title=\"Primordial Spectre\">Primordial Spectre</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Ptaris%27_Mental_Image\" title=\"Ptaris' Mental Image\">Ptaris' Mental Image</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Rocky\" title=\"Rocky\">Rocky</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Sarin\" title=\"Sarin\">Sarin</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Shadow\" title=\"Shadow\">Shadow</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Shadow_Friend\" title=\"Shadow Friend\">Shadow Friend</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Shadow_Plush\" title=\"Shadow Plush\">Shadow Plush</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Spectral_Flumph\" title=\"Spectral Flumph\">Spectral Flumph</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Spiritual_Weapon_(greataxe)\" title=\"Spiritual Weapon (greataxe)\">Spiritual Weapon (greataxe)</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Spiritual_Weapon_(greatsword)\" title=\"Spiritual Weapon (greatsword)\">Spiritual Weapon (greatsword)</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Spiritual_Weapon_(halberd)\" title=\"Spiritual Weapon (halberd)\">Spiritual Weapon (halberd)</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Spiritual_Weapon_(maul)\" title=\"Spiritual Weapon (maul)\">Spiritual Weapon (maul)</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Spiritual_Weapon_(spear)\" title=\"Spiritual Weapon (spear)\">Spiritual Weapon (spear)</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Spiritual_Weapon_(trident)\" title=\"Spiritual Weapon (trident)\">Spiritual Weapon (trident)</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/The_Judge\" title=\"The Judge\">The Judge</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Tormented_Soul\" title=\"Tormented Soul\">Tormented Soul</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Tribunal_Ghost\" title=\"Tribunal Ghost\">Tribunal Ghost</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Vengeful_Soul\" title=\"Vengeful Soul\">Vengeful Soul</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Water_Myrmidon\" title=\"Water Myrmidon\">Water Myrmidon</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Wraith\" title=\"Wraith\">Wraith</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Zina\" title=\"Zina\">Zina</a></li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>This passive feature usually means that the affected creature cannot be moved by any type of spell or action. However, for Elementals and Myrmidons, it only specifically prevents <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shove\" title=\"Shove\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6b/Shove_Icon.webp/25px-Shove_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6b/Shove_Icon.webp/38px-Shove_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6b/Shove_Icon.webp/50px-Shove_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Shove\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6b/Shove_Icon.webp/25px-Shove_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6b/Shove_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Shove\" title=\"Shove\">Shove</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Throw\" title=\"Throw\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp/25px-Throw_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp/38px-Throw_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp/50px-Throw_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp/25px-Throw_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Throw\" title=\"Throw\">Throw</a>, or <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Improvised_Melee_Weapon\" title=\"Improvised Melee Weapon\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/52/Improvised_Melee_Weapon_Icon.webp/25px-Improvised_Melee_Weapon_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/52/Improvised_Melee_Weapon_Icon.webp/38px-Improvised_Melee_Weapon_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/52/Improvised_Melee_Weapon_Icon.webp/50px-Improvised_Melee_Weapon_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Improvised Melee Weapon\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/52/Improvised_Melee_Weapon_Icon.webp/25px-Improvised_Melee_Weapon_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/52/Improvised_Melee_Weapon_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Improvised_Melee_Weapon\" title=\"Improvised Melee Weapon\">Improvised Melee Weapon</a>, and they can still be moved by other spells and actions, such as <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Gust_of_Wind\" title=\"Gust of Wind\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/58/Gust_of_Wind_Icon.webp/25px-Gust_of_Wind_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/58/Gust_of_Wind_Icon.webp/38px-Gust_of_Wind_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/58/Gust_of_Wind_Icon.webp/50px-Gust_of_Wind_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Gust of Wind\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/58/Gust_of_Wind_Icon.webp/25px-Gust_of_Wind_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/58/Gust_of_Wind_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Gust_of_Wind\" title=\"Gust of Wind\">Gust of Wind</a>.</li>\n<li>This passive persists through being <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Polymorphed_(Condition)\" title=\"Polymorphed (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/10/Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/10/Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/10/Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Polymorphed\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/10/Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/10/Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Polymorphed_(Condition)\" title=\"Polymorphed (Condition)\">Polymorphed</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>   <div class=\"bg3wiki-preview-only\">\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Brief_preview\"> Brief preview </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">Can't be shoved, thrown, or used as an improvised melee weapon.</div>\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714201350\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.063 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.072 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2317/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 16843/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 8305/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 21/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 3307/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.010/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 852771/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   60.471      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   60.471      1 -total\n 32.41%   19.598      8 Template:Icon_link\n 31.97%   19.331      7 Template:SAI\n 31.10%   18.804      8 Template:Icon_text\n 25.86%   15.638     17 Template:Trim\n 15.48%    9.361      8 Template:Ifempty\n 14.27%    8.628      1 Template:Passive_creatures_list\n 14.16%    8.564      1 Template:Uid\n  9.24%    5.590      1 Template:Template_style\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:10689-0!canonical 